{"title":"Christmas Daily Advent Calendar","slug":"Christmas_Daily_Advent_Calendar","pageid":3634,"revid":20887,"timestamp":"2025-12-22T20:07:58Z","lastEditor":"Oaklandsman","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Axe","fields":[{"label":"Price","value":"15 minutes of gameplay"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Version 1.71.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"id":"list-of-rewards","text":"List of Rewards"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>The <b>Christmas Daily Advent Calendar</b> was added in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.71.0/\">Version 1.71.0</a> alongside the other Christmas Event items. It is a 25-day advent calendar in which you have to be in the game for 15 minutes to claim a daily prize.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"list-of-rewards\">List of Rewards</h2>\n<p>Since it is limited, the calendar won't be around for long. The table below are the documented rewards:\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: New Button to access the advent calendar.\">New Button to access the advent calendar.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>New Button to access the advent calendar.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>List of 2024 Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Day\n</th>\n<th>Reward\n</th>\n<th>Date\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Day 1\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Snowfall/\">Gift of Snowfall</a>\n</td>\n<td>12/01/24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Day 2\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Christmas_Popper/\">Christmas Popper</a>\n</td>\n<td>12/02/24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Day 3\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Snowfall/\">Gift of Snowfall</a>\n</td>\n<td>12/03/24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Day 4\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Christmas_Popper/\">Christmas Popper</a>\n</td>\n<td>12/04/24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Day 5\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Snowfall/\">Gift of Snowfall</a>\n</td>\n<td>12/05/24\n</td></tr>\n<